@startuml
' Ekte Mat Online - state machine for Order (INFO212), 2026-10-22
' State names correspond to the OrderStatus enumeration in the class diagram.
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
title Order - state machine

[*] --> Requested : booking request submitted (US-02)\n/ phone order registered (US-09)\n/ generated from standing order (US-27)

Requested --> Rejected : declined by coordinator\n[no capacity] (US-10)
Requested --> AwaitingDeposit : accepted [deposit required]\n(US-22; scope ISS-01)
Requested --> Confirmed : accepted [no deposit required]\n/ send confirmation (US-04)
AwaitingDeposit --> Confirmed : deposit paid via Vipps\n/ send confirmation (US-21, US-22)

Confirmed : entry / show on kitchen overview (US-15)
Confirmed : 7 days before event / send reminder (US-12)
Confirmed --> Confirmed : guest numbers or allergies changed\n[before deadline, ISS-03] (US-11)
Confirmed --> InPreparation : preparation starts\n[allergies confirmed] (US-16)
InPreparation --> Delivered : delivered or picked up (US-14)
Delivered --> Invoiced : invoice transferred to Fiken\nor Vipps payment captured (US-21, US-23, US-24)

Requested --> Cancelled : cancellation requested (US-13; ISS-04)
AwaitingDeposit --> Cancelled : cancellation requested (US-13; ISS-04)
Confirmed --> Cancelled : cancellation requested\n[terms not defined] (US-13; ISS-04)

Rejected --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]
Invoiced --> [*]

note right of Cancelled
  Cancellation is only supported by US-13
  (Could) and its terms are missing (ISS-04).
  Included because the assignment asks for it.
end note
@enduml
